er-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">OLLIE.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d2/OLLIE..png/revision/latest?cb=20210211202535\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"OLLIE.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d2/OLLIE..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202535\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d2/OLLIE..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202535 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d2/OLLIE..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210211202535 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"OLLIE.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"OLLIE..png\" data-image-name=\"OLLIE..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">7</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\">Rhod Gilbert</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twelve_blush_majesty_two.\" title=\"Twelve blush majesty two.\">Twelve blush majesty two.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lotta_soup.\" title=\"Lotta soup.\">Lotta soup.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<dl><dd><i>For the prop, see <a href=\"/wiki/Ollie_the_Knight\" title=\"Ollie the Knight\">Ollie the Knight</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<p><i><b>OLLIE.</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">Series 7</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 26 September 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\">Rhod Gilbert</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/OLLIE.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"OLLIE\" is the name of the knight prop that first appears in this series. In this specific episode, it is what could be read on the weighing scale display once the contestants successfully solved the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_these_scales_read_31.770kg\" title=\"Make these scales read 31.770kg\">Make these scales read 31.770kg</a> task. Following the screening of everyone's attempt at the task, <a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\">James Acaster</a> yells his name before the reveal. The title card is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Work_out_what_happens_when_you_flick_this_switch_on\" title=\"Work out what happens when you flick this switch on\">Work out what happens when you flick this switch on</a> task.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/OLLIE.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">James Acaster</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Knappett\" title=\"Jessica Knappett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jessica Knappett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kerry Godliman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Wang</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rhod Gilbert</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_confusing_thing\" title=\"Most confusing thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most confusing thing.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Work_out_what_happens_when_you_flick_this_switch_on\" title=\"Work out what happens when you flick this switch on\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Work out what happens when you flick this switch on. You may not take this switch out of this room.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dramatically_alter_your_appearance\" title=\"Dramatically alter your appearance\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Dramatically alter your appearance. You may start altering your appearance when you are inside the lift and the doors have closed. You must stop altering your appearance when the doors open again.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_these_scales_read_31.770kg\" title=\"Make these scales read 31.770kg\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make these scales read 31.770kg. The scales must read 31.770kg for at least 5 seconds.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Correctly_don_the_most_items_of_clothing\" title=\"Correctly don the most items of clothing\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Correctly don the most items of clothing.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_loo_roll_paper_airplane\" title=\"Make the best loo roll paper airplane\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best loo roll paper airplane.\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.